annotate @btg.node:0 The root: a Selector tries its children left to right
annotate @btg.node:1 Right-click a node: Add Child, Wrap In, Change To, Move, Delete
annotate @btg.node:4 The selected node (drag a node onto another to move it)
annotate @btg.number The selected node's settings, by kind
annotate @btg.page:blackboard The tree's starting blackboard values
